picovoxel is an unofficial, community-maintained TypeScript/WebAssembly binding
of PicoGK. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by LEAP 71.

This product includes material derived from the following LEAP 71 projects,
each licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0):

  PicoGK ("peacock"), a compact software kernel for computational geometry
  Copyright (c) 2023-2026 LEAP 71, https://leap71.com
  https://github.com/leap71/PicoGK
  The TypeScript API is a semantic port of the C# library (see
  MIGRATING-FROM-CSHARP.md).

  PicoGKRuntime, compiled to WebAssembly with modifications
  Copyright (c) 2023-2026 LEAP 71
  https://github.com/leap71/PicoGKRuntime (built from commit 0f26321c)

  LEAP71_ShapeKernel (ported to TypeScript under src/shapekernel/)
  Copyright (c) 2023-2026 LEAP 71
  https://github.com/leap71/LEAP71_ShapeKernel

  LEAP71_LatticeLibrary (ported to TypeScript under src/latticelibrary/)
  Copyright (c) 2023-2026 LEAP 71
  https://github.com/leap71/LEAP71_LatticeLibrary

Modifications to PicoGKRuntime (Apache License 2.0, section 4(b)). The
WebAssembly modules in this package are built from PicoGKRuntime with these
changes, each kept as a patch or a script in the source repository:

  patches/PicoGKRuntime/0001-parallel-disjoint-mesh-flatten.patch
  patches/PicoGKRuntime/0002-post-fill-prune.patch
  patches/PicoGKRuntime/0003-lattice-parameter-accessors.patch
  patches/PicoGKRuntime/0004-lattice-beam-value-storage.patch
  patches/PicoGKRuntime/0005-render-mesh-zero-copy.patch
  scripts/make-core-tu.sh: compiles a copy of Source/PicoGKLibrary.cpp that
    ends before the viewer exports and comments out the three viewer
    includes; no other line is changed.

The modules also contain nine translation units written for picovoxel
(src/pico-boolean.cpp, pico-bulk.cpp, pico-hash.cpp, pico-lattice.cpp,
pico-offset.cpp, pico-props.cpp, pico-query.cpp, pico-tape.cpp,
pico-zslice.cpp), which add exports against the PicoGKRuntime headers.

