OpenVDB is built without Blosc, zlib or OpenEXR support; none of them is in
the package.

The source repository's examples/ directory, which is not part of the npm
package, includes ports of LEAP71_RoverWheel, LEAP71_HelixHeatX,
LEAP71_QuasiCrystals and PicoGK example code (Apache-2.0, Copyright LEAP 71),
and of PicoGK_Examples and PicoGK_SimulationExample (CC0-1.0).
